{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,240p' HARNESS.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Evaluation Harness\n\nThis treatment maps existing project truth; it does not replace it.\n\n1. Read the current task and the paths in `harness-project-map.json` that apply.\n2. Distinguish intended behavior from current code and runtime evidence.\n3. Make only the requested change. Preserve unrelated and locally modified files.\n4. Run fresh, applicable project-native proof. A missing or failed check is reported, never converted to a pass.\n5. For runtime work, use the declared boot, exercise, observe, and reset commands.\n6. Report changed files, commands, results, and unresolved risk.\n\nRun `node scripts/check-harness-map.mjs` to validate the map. If `.harness/modules/` exists, read only the module files activated for the task.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,240p' scripts/validate.sh && sed -n '1,240p' scripts/check-local.sh && sed -n '1,240p' scripts/check-harness-map.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,240p' scripts/validate.sh && sed -n '1,240p' scripts/check-local.sh && sed -n '1,240p' scripts/check-harness-map.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"#!/bin/sh\nset -eu\nnode test/unit.mjs\n#!/bin/sh\nset -eu\ntest -f config/local.json\necho local-pass\n#!/usr/bin/env node\nimport { access, readFile, readdir } from 'node:fs/promises';\n\nconst map = JSON.parse(await readFile('harness-project-map.json', 'utf8'));\nif (map.schemaVersion !== 1) throw new Error('unsupported project-map schema');\nfor (const key of ['authority', 'intendedTruth', 'currentBehavior', 'runtime', 'proof']) {\n  if (!map[key]) throw new Error(`missing project-map field: ${key}`);\n}\nfor (const item of [map.authority, ...map.intendedTruth, ...map.currentBehavior]) await access(item);\nconst packageJson = JSON.parse(await readFile('package.json', 'utf8'));\nfor (const command of [...Object.values(map.runtime), ...map.proof]) {\n  if (!command.startsWith('npm run ')) continue;\n  const name = command.slice('npm run '.length).split(/\\s+/)[0];\n  if (!packageJson.scripts?.[name]) throw new Error(`missing package script: ${name}`);\n}\ntry {\n  const modules = (await readdir('.harness/modules')).filter((name) => name.endsWith('.md'));\n  if (modules.length === 0) throw new Error('module directory exists but is empty');\n} catch (error) {\n  if (error.code !== 'ENOENT') throw error;\n}\nconsole.log('Harness project map valid.');\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
