{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,240p' AGENTS.md && find .harness -maxdepth 3 -type f -print -exec sed -n '1,200p' {} \\\\;\"","aggregated_output":"# Agent Instructions\n\n## Authority\n\n- For an answer, explanation, review, diagnosis, plan, or status request, inspect only what is needed and keep the repository read-only.\n- For an explicit change request, read the current task and `HARNESS.md`, keep edits inside the requested scope, and run the project-native checks named in `harness-project-map.json`.\n- Stop and report the conflict before publishing, changing credentials, weakening proof, deleting project-owned work, or expanding beyond the task.\n- Existing product truth and architecture remain project-owned. Harness guidance never invents a second product specification.\n.harness/modules.json\n{\n  \"activationAuthority\": \"candidate manifest activationProfiles\",\n  \"available\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"work-coordination\",\n      \"path\": \".harness/modules/work-coordination.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"evidence\",\n      \"path\": \".harness/modules/evidence.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"high-risk-proof\",\n      \"path\": \".harness/modules/high-risk-proof.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"brownfield-ownership\",\n      \"path\": \".harness/modules/brownfield-ownership.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"runtime-observability\",\n      \"path\": \".harness/modules/runtime-observability.md\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"discovery\": \".harness/modules/*.md\",\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1\n}\n.harness/modules/brownfield-ownership.md\n# Brownfield Ownership Module\n\nInspect existing owners and local modifications before writing. Preserve unrelated dirty files. Never infer ownership from pathname alone. If intended truth, current behavior, and an external owner disagree, report the conflict and stop before destructive reconciliation.\n.harness/install-receipt.json\n{\n  \"candidate\": \"MODULAR_CORE\",\n  \"manager\": \"evaluation-materializer-v1\",\n  \"ownership\": \"only checksum-matching files listed by the selected activation profile\",\n  \"productionLifecycleClaim\": false,\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
